cae924cf6e06991abb42f655846d02772","published_at":"2026-11-16T18:16:07Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"MoEngage 介绍其如何利用 Amazon Bedrock 与 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 构建 Merlin AI，并通过 MCP 将分群、历史活动和内容库等能力开放给 Claude、ChatGPT 等兼容客户端。","title":"How MoEngage built agentic customer engagement on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_977d02a4da406cd8e25ea62cd18a8c0116d1703e436ad59d1f331dd726a06b88","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-blogs_podcasts-production-mlops-at-gs-caltex-with-amazon-sagemake-0-4536e10993/","observation_id":"obs_4536e10993f7030af8c202010afc26234a100576c2a235c65b97303580c3bc39","published_at":"2026-11-13T23:22:09Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"GS Caltex 介绍了如何将 Amazon SageMaker Canvas 中构建并验证的模型与预处理流程，接入 Amazon SageMaker Pipelines 的生产工作流。其目标是缩短部署周期，并支持定时批量推理。","title":"Production MLOps at GS Caltex with Amazon SageMaker Canvas, part 1"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5e22b24ddc6dc9f11c3a9a5db79f693deb049ce9ebd3e0aebd96c58530f0e162","internal_url":"/posts/20261116-arxiv-training-reasoning-models-in-simulation-to-nativel-2-084301ebd6/","observation_id":"obs_084301ebd6f9e5a465f93c04978347e6359694c288d5461e34fa2decd9106f92","published_at":"2026-11-13T18:59:02Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究提出 PEAR，通过机器人使用强化学习（RURL），仅在仿真环境中、无需示范数据地训练 27B 开源权重推理模型，使其能够直接为真实机器人生成末端执行器位姿。","title":"Training Reasoning Models in Simulation to Natively Use Real Robots"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d813703d1d8ece00b1f84a28c4d64c52eb55108d62f16571603bde9fc01ecaca","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-blogs_podcasts-introducing-chatgpt-wallet-0-7d4d71d056/","observation_id":"obs_7d4d71d056da02862d0b2ec1b87dadd7019731481c576401840bf8ff718ee663","published_at":"2026-11-13T15:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Introducing ChatGPT Wallet"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_3ef71bf30bbf1eb5c3cf423bddacd2d7b0c4cd80dae9f6ba8fd1f3ac680f837f","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-arxiv-internalizing-investment-mandates-a-neurosymbolic--0-abcecd6333/","observation_id":"obs_abcecd6333f5ed1bdbe0e7085d07e9646945ccac172ebdf75fc1cf1a93e35680","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:59:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"论文将可微分的符号逻辑监督引入连续资产配置，使智能体在学习过程中掌握投资政策声明的约束，而非在执行后补救违规。实验显示，在六条随市场状态变化的规则下，违规率明显低于无约束强化学习和奖励惩罚方法。","title":"Internalizing Investment Mandates: A Neurosymbolic RL Approach to Portfolio Allocation"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_8fc1dac9dcdcbcb2f58e259523a7875f879e074e091d701c05f10125bcdf9001","internal_url":"/posts/20261114-arxiv-agentssl-can-mle-agents-leverage-unlabeled-data-0-0eeb85033b/","observation_id":"obs_0eeb85033b17e767df2baf29952590b87a1d0a37fafcf55314bf3032800cc91f","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:59:06Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"AgentSSL 研究 MLE 智能体在标注数据有限、未标注数据丰富时，能否自动组合并改进半监督学习方案。实验显示其在多数设置中超过人工基线，但程序选择仍会造成明显性能下降，并配套提出 ProgramSelectBench 基准。","title":"AgentSSL: Can MLE Agents Leverage Unlabeled Data?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_155205a4f5d7b2566ae335294c006f4b5c3d321a75bbada04827a522ad888bcd","internal_url":"/posts/20261115-arxiv-coremem-cost-internalizing-memory-for-successive-c-0-21fb7be8e1/","observation_id":"obs_21fb7be8e1ad838382dac69bd380e79bc41ed2c103bc993095e2b1120932de21","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:58:22Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"CoReMem 是一种面向连续编程任务的记忆框架，在写入、读取记忆时权衡成本与未来收益。它通过比较下一任务在不同记忆条件下的表现，筛选更有价值的代码库位置与可执行检查。","title":"CoReMem: Cost-Internalizing Memory for Successive Coding Tasks with Prospective Valuation"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_75652dc861592c234e2fae4d15983948199915ef11c45d74b7e69306b21913aa","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-blogs_podcasts-optimizing-cost-per-task-and-proving-agent-roi-on--0-409a77b0b1/","observation_id":"obs_409a77b0b17a5148c50fa2d34fd8e289467f415901180490ea46c922f91886bd","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:43:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这套方法不再只看模型的 token 单价，而是按完整任务核算成本，并纳入分词效率、输出冗长度、代理循环次数和推理开销。它还通过人工基线、对照实验和五维评分卡，衡量智能体相对人工的表现与投资回报。","title":"Optimizing cost per task and proving agent ROI on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_334f59cf098e7f637657ae0b8e4f421c7eb680e9141e248df31f58dce8db47f4","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-build-autonomous-ai-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-and-0-df6566d4fc/","observation_id":"obs_df6566d4fc91840890def19461933475d9c7a30723709bdf51469ad99565d346","published_at":"2026-11-12T01:18:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇面向 Java 团队的实战指南，介绍如何结合 Spring AI 与 Amazon Bedrock 构建可规划任务、调用工具并保留上下文的自主 AI 智能体。示例涵盖单智能体旅行助手和多智能体文档处理系统。","title":"Build autonomous AI agents with Amazon Bedrock and Spring AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_95cecb8305083349bfbcf3c8cc41a86f82493018d67030f9a80456f39f7daaff","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-hacker_news-united-airlines-bans-ai-agents-from-booking-flight-4-1df6a00742/","observation_id":"obs_1df6a00742e99b5a005c0a78a421a5b6942e095ec0450cf2125be3f75497863a","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:24:35Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"United Airlines bans AI agents from booking flights on behalf of travelers"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_41d3f459fdf663c57644e0e2751ead5861c390fbdd58b9793d32be7cc3125a0a","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-aiml--0-e3fb265c4a/","observation_id":"obs_e3fb265c4a7f0c03e332381c674e35ece02aac3c1eec6df11ee65ed9b8e8bec6","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:05:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份面向 AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML 专题的参会指南，介绍不同会话形式，并按 AI 芯片、模型训练与推理、智能体开发及管理等层级整理相关学习内容。内容还梳理了 AWS 从基础设施到智能体解决方案的 AI 技术栈。","title":"The attendee’s guide to the AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML track"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ef45433b032bc579e197be1c644e0ea3e441835116fed8a0b8d4f1a1949fee7e","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-blogs_podcasts-the-agent-evaluation-playbook-built-in-deepeval-an-0-6d77a575f5/","observation_id":"obs_6d77a575f579de9bddf060a1269b34c406ecd2d2de042436b64417f39ef25e85","published_at":"2026-11-10T22:35:03Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于智能体评估实践的技术文章，介绍如何以业务目标为起点，将成功标准拆解为可观察行为，再映射到轨迹级或会话级评估器。文章重点讲解 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 中内置评估器、DeepEval 和 AutoEval 的用途及组合方式。","title":"The agent evaluation playbook: Built-in, DeepEval, and AutoEval on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_8b8c2e498a2724f40dce556760995e3b489348c4cb21300d916064d4d0ecdf46","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-arxiv-contrastive-discovery-open-ended-scientific-discov-1-0ada6edaa8/","observation_id":"obs_0ada6edaa8802c6af289894ab967fcf35b0a0535c053bc2fcc11ff5fc424d2a9","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:58:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究提出“对比式发现”：让智能体同时评估一组相互排斥、覆盖完整备选方案的科学解释，并根据实验后各解释的信念变化判断问题是否解决。","title":"Contrastive Discovery: Open-Ended Scientific Discovery over Competing Explanations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_1c1d3cbb4c57dec1c8416b056f3b0531555a5b726d5fb643b6ac574b7d881ec2","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-arxiv-pyrite-building-and-benchmarking-protein-ligand-po-1-57d7d2f6b4/","observation_id":"obs_57d7d2f6b4aa20be2834015865dea887cbf8be89f9724b5395fb34f3c536100c","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:56:32Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"Pyrite 是蛋白质—配体结合姿态排序基准，包含 1,500 组姿态对。它结合结构化分子表示 PyriteRep，以及直接比较姿态的 PyriteReasoner 和生成特征代码的 PyriteFeaturizer 两类 LLM 智能体。","title":"Pyrite: Building and Benchmarking Prot